# Week 2 tests - run from top to bottom after starting the server (npm start)

### 1. Get all movies (200, array)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies

### 2. Get one movie (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### 3. Get a missing movie (404 MOVIE_NOT_FOUND)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/999

### 4. Create a valid movie (201, server creates id 4)
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Arrival",
  "year": 2016,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### 5. Create an invalid movie (400 VALIDATION_ERROR with details)
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "year": "not a number"
}

### 6. Replace a movie with PUT (200, all fields replaced)
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception: Updated Edition",
  "year": 2010,
  "genre": "Sci-Fi"
}

### 7. Invalid incomplete PUT (400, genre and year missing)
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception"
}

### 8. PUT a missing movie (404)
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Nothing",
  "year": 2000,
  "genre": "Drama"
}

### 9. Partially update a movie with PATCH (200, only year changes)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2011
}

### 10. PATCH with an invalid value (400)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 1500
}

### 11. Filter by genre (200, case-insensitive)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=sci-fi

### 12. Filter by minYear (200)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?minYear=2010

### 13. Filter and sort (200, only matching movies, oldest first)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=Sci-Fi&minYear=2000&sort=year

### 14. Sort by title (200, alphabetical)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?sort=title

### 15. No matches (200, empty array)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?genre=Musical

### 16. Invalid minYear (400)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?minYear=invalid

### 17. Invalid sort value (400)
GET http://localhost:3000/movies?sort=rating

### 18. Delete an existing movie (204, empty body)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### 19. Delete the same movie again (404)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/1

### 20. Unknown route (404 ROUTE_NOT_FOUND)
GET http://localhost:3000/does-not-exist
